    dcterms:description "This RDF dataset provides knowledge graphs produced by processing articles from Agritrop - the open repository of CIRAD publications. These knowledge graphs provide articles' metadata, extracted text, Agrovoc and GeoNames descriptors, named entities identified and disambiguated by Entity-fishing and DBpedia Spotlight." ;
